doc Loop with the condition tested at the top; break and continue jump to its labels.
  `break` jumps to `{L.end}` and `continue` to `{L.next}`, which runs the
  `next` block before testing the condition again.

needs bintables/jfalse
emit
  {L.top}:
  {cond!jfalse L.end}
  {body}
  {L.next}:
  {step}
  jmp {L.top}
  {L.end}:
